1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,267
If the referee raises an arm, that

2
00:00:02,079 --> 00:00:03,876
free kick cannot go straight in.

3
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:05,648
Difference one:

4
00:00:05,610 --> 00:00:06,377
scoring.

5
00:00:06,972 --> 00:00:08,850
A direct free kick can go straight

6
00:00:08,662 --> 00:00:09,510
into the net.

7
00:00:10,108 --> 00:00:12,241
An indirect one needs another player to

8
00:00:12,053 --> 00:00:13,005
touch the ball.

9
00:00:13,866 --> 00:00:15,524
And if an indirect kick flies in

10
00:00:15,336 --> 00:00:17,260
untouched, it is not a goal.

11
00:00:17,855 --> 00:00:19,016
It is a goal kick.

12
00:00:19,882 --> 00:00:20,811
Difference two:

13
00:00:20,889 --> 00:00:21,807
the offence.

14
00:00:22,401 --> 00:00:23,088
Direct:

15
00:00:23,119 --> 00:00:26,409
contact, like trips, pushes or holding, plus

16
00:00:26,221 --> 00:00:27,011
handball.

17
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:28,400
Indirect:

18
00:00:28,362 --> 00:00:30,900
dangerous play, offside or the back-pass to

19
00:00:30,712 --> 00:00:31,444
the keeper.

20
00:00:32,306 --> 00:00:33,328
Difference three:

21
00:00:33,348 --> 00:00:34,149
the box.

22
00:00:34,744 --> 00:00:36,819
A direct free kick offence inside the

23
00:00:36,631 --> 00:00:37,942
area is a penalty.

24
00:00:38,541 --> 00:00:40,893
An indirect one stays an indirect free

25
00:00:40,705 --> 00:00:41,275
kick.

26
00:00:42,138 --> 00:00:43,819
So watch the referee's arm.

27
00:00:44,414 --> 00:00:45,089
Arm up:

28
00:00:45,109 --> 00:00:45,980
indirect.

29
00:00:46,858 --> 00:00:48,644
Save it, and share it with whoever

30
00:00:48,455 --> 00:00:50,414
shoots at goal from every free kick.

